ant to make."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le09ob05re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le09ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le09ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le09ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<p>You are never too old to reinvent yourself. You often hear people lamenting about the past saying if only I had studied harder, I could have been a doctor, or I would have climbed the corporate ladder by now  if I had only taken a chance that time, or I would have been happy if I had stayed with so and so.</p>\n<p>I'm here to tell you folks that living in the past is harmful because it keeps you trapped in a world that no longer exists and does not allow you to move forward. </p>", "id": 1}, {"time": "28000", "image": "engenn9le09ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<p>What people don't realize is that change is good. It maybe painful at first, seem radical, perhaps even  frightening, but change provides an important aspect that people need; personal growth. </p>\n<p>Change leads to opportunities and experiences; change enables people to become learners and most importantly; change ensures that life stays interesting.</p>\n<p>However, it is important to make goals so change doesn't sneak up on you.<br/>\nHere are a few for my near future goals that I will share with you. Please repeat!<br/>", "id": 2}, {"time": "62000", "image": "engenn9le09ob05re2img03.jpg", "text": "<p>In five years,<br/>\nI will have learned from my mistakes and not dwelt on them. I will never say if only I had done this, then I would have been that. <br/>\nI will have sought out new experiences and new opportunities.<br/>\nI will have embraced change no matter how scary.<br/>\nI will not be working at a job I do not enjoy.<br/>\nI will be  learning at every moment of every day.</p>\n<p>Because you are never too old  ... to change.\n</p>", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Getting the Job You Want"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Never Too Old"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Third Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are four types of conditional sentences in English:<ol><li>Zero Conditional - to talk about certainty and facts</li><li>First Conditional - to talk about real possibilities in the present or the future</li><li>Second Conditional - to talk about <span class=\"italic\">unreal</span> possibilities in the present or the future</li><li>Third Conditional - to talk about unreal <span class=\"italic\">past</span> situations</li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use third conditional to talk about unreal situations in the past. <br/>These are things that did not happen in the past. You often use the third conditional to talk about regrets."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart below for the structure of the third conditional:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Conditional Name</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Structure</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Example</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Third \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> + Past Perfect, <span class=\\\"italic\\\">could</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">would have</span> + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If only <span class=\\\"strong\\\">I had studied</span> harder, I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">could have been</span> a doctor. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If only I had studied harder, I could have been a doctor."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I would have climbed the corporate ladder by now if I had only taken a chance that time."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I would have been happy if I had stayed with so and so."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If only I had done this, then I would have been that. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future Continuous Tense vs. The Future Perfect Tense "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Future Continuous tense to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.<br/>You use the Future Perfect tense to talk about an action in the future before another action in the future. This is the past in the future. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span> tense, the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">will be working</span> at 4 p.m. tomorrow. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The person will start work at some point in the future and be working at 4 p.m. It is not clear when the person will stop working. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure of the Future Continuous is: <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will</span> + <span class=\"italic\">be</span> + verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">will be learning</span> at every moment of every day.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can sometimes think of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect</span> tense like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">You can call me at work at 8 a.m. I <span class=\"strong\">will have arrived</span> at the office by 8.  <br/>The train will leave the station at 9 a.m. You will arrive at the station at 9:15 a.m. When you arrive, the train <span class=\"strong\">will have left</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure of the Future Perfect tense is: <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will </span>+ (<span class=\"italic\">not</span>) <span class=\"italic\">have </span>+ past participle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">will have sought out</span> new experiences and new opportunities.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " *Notice the position of <span class=\"italic\">not</span>. It comes between <span class=\"italic\">will</span> and <span class=\"italic\">have</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "In five years, I will have learned from my mistakes and not dwelt on them."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will have embraced change no matter how scary."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will not be working at a job I do not enjoy."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will be learning at every moment of every day."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tell a story to a partner about a time you had to make a big change in your life."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss what you did and how you felt during the change."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Then write about your plans for the next year about a big change you want to make."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Try to use Future Perfect Continuous and Future Perfect."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your writing to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss your goals with them and get their opinion of them as well."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I express my feelings and emotions about change."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write goals and identify objectives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express my goals clearly and to a partner."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le09ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to reinvent"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to remake "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are never too old to reinvent yourself. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "climb the corporate ladder"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the series of steps people go through as they gain more power in a corporation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If only I had studied harder, I could have been a doctor, or I would have climbed the corporate ladder by now"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "so and so"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "said when you don't know his or her name or you would rather not say the person's name"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would have been happy if I had stayed with so and so."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "folks "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm here to tell you folks that living in the past is harmful because it keeps you trapped in a world that no longer exists and does not allow you to move forward. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "radical"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be extreme"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It maybe painful at first, seem radical, perhaps even  frightening, but change provides an important aspect that people need; personal growth. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aspect"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a particular part of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It maybe painful at first, seem radical, perhaps even  frightening, but change provides an important aspect that people need; personal growth. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to ensure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to guarantee, make sure"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: change ensures that life stays interesting."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob05aud07"}]}]}